ath HTL\",\n      \"url\": \"https://horwathhtl.com/publication/lombok-hotel-branded-residences-2025/\",\n      \"date\": \"2025\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","logprobs":[],"annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://lovebali.baliprov.go.id/faq","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://lovebali.baliprov.go.id/faq"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.travelweekly-asia.com/Destination-Travel/Is-Lombok-set-to-be-Indonesia-s-next-big-beach-star-","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.travelweekly-asia.com/Destination-Travel/Is-Lombok-set-to-be-Indonesia-s-next-big-beach-star-"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.balihotelsassociation.com/monthly-passengers-statistic/2025/","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.balihotelsassociation.com/monthly-passengers-statistic/2025/"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.facebook.com/TheStarOnline/posts/koster-said-bali-recorded-a-historic-high-of-seven-million-foreign-tourist-arriv/1352540270241828/","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.facebook.com/TheStarOnline/posts/koster-said-bali-recorded-a-historic-high-of-seven-million-foreign-tourist-arriv/1352540270241828/"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.scribd.com/document/949013295/5-Ranking-2025-6","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.scribd.com/document/949013295/5-Ranking-2025-6"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.asiamediacentre.org.nz/dragons-trash-and-empty-nets-inside-komodos-new-tourism-limits","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.asiamediacentre.org.nz/dragons-trash-and-empty-nets-inside-komodos-new-tourism-limits"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bali-hotels-association_visitor-statistics-bali-hotels-association-activity-7425459622548926464-TBD4","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bali-hotels-association_visitor-statistics-bali-hotels-association-activity-7425459622548926464-TBD4"},{"type":"url_citation","